   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Views 1-4 are the four C4 levels, each zooming into the one before (the zoom menu lists what can be drawn on request).\nLater views are extra diagrams: the data, and the states things move through. Red pins = places it can crack.\nPaths start at the project root; ending in / means a folder. Drawn from commit 4f2c9e1 on 2026-10-16.",
   "originalText": "Views 1-4 are the four C4 levels, each zooming into the one before (the zoom menu lists what can be drawn on request).\nLater views are extra diagrams: the data, and the states things move through. Red pins = places it can crack.\nPaths start at the project root; ending in / means a folder. Drawn from commit 4f2c9e1 on 2026-10-16.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
